WEBVTT

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:19.670
Hm? How can he be so certain
where he is going?

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:25.360
The time...

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:27.170
- ...has come.
- ...has come.

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:52.110
Blue water...

00:01:07.110 --> 00:01:08.760
What on earth?

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:11.550
It's the ark...

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:53.080
Hullo! Ka-ching!

00:02:53.180 --> 00:02:56.190
Hul-lo! Ka-ching, ka-ching!

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:59.230
You look splendid, my good fellow!

00:02:59.310 --> 00:03:01.980
Piffle, my good sir!
It is <i>you</i> who looks fabulous!

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:04.940
- I don't hold a candle to you, old chap!
- Nonsense, you needn't be so modest!

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:04.940
Rein it in a little, antlings.

00:03:04.940 --> 00:03:07.200
Wow, look at Tsubaki...

00:03:04.940 --> 00:03:07.200
We're fabulously wealthy!

00:03:07.690 --> 00:03:09.570
Debauchery, here we come!

00:03:07.690 --> 00:03:12.200
I'm gonna put you in the best bridal outfit
on the whole island! Just you wait!

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:16.140
He totally looks like someone who
was just defeated in something.

00:03:16.240 --> 00:03:18.610
Yeah, he's a real pro
at wringing out the pathos.

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:22.810
That reminds me, where are
Yukimaru, Fena, and Shitan?

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:25.210
Hey, you're right.
Where'd they go?

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:32.570
Two <i>shaku</i>, 8 <i>sun</i> in length.
The end of the blade is <i>shobu</i> style.

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:37.230
The hilt is consistent.
Tsumugari-no-Tachi, white metallic in color...

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:41.010
No doubt about it, this is--

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:43.980
Fena! Yukimaru! Shitan!

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:47.110
Hey! If you're out there,
say something!

00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:48.490
What's the matter?

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:54.780
<b>11. At Mission's End</b>

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:52.880
Nobody's seen them?

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:54.700
I can't believe you guys!

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:57.600
Seriously, everybody lost their heads
at the sight of all this treasure!

00:03:57.700 --> 00:03:59.280
Like you two can talk!

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:02.260
I did see them walking off
towards the upper area.

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:04.820
Same here.
And it was a while ago, too.

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:07.510
You mean they've been missing
ever since then?

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:10.560
Anyway, let's go search that area
and meet up with them.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:12.640
We can worry about
our next move after--

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:20.590
What's the matter, Tsubaki?

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:22.200
Tsubaki?

00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:35.660
This is-- It's really--

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:38.660
This is the Vault of the Earth.

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:41.470
The <i>San Miguel.</i>
Captain Kidd.

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:44.140
The Holy Grail.
The Ark of the Covenant.

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:48.090
The Knights Templar.
The treasure of La Noche Triste.

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:52.680
Lost treasures from all around
the globe are located here.

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:56.890
They were gathered in this place
by those with a calling.

00:04:56.960 --> 00:05:00.390
Stored away in preparation for the day
when they would be needed.

00:05:04.440 --> 00:05:06.690
I found it!

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:11.820
It's all mine!

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:26.780
Anyone who becomes blinded by
the treasure and loses control

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:28.550
will be killed on the spot.

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:33.010
I didn't hear an answer.

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:34.520
A-Aye aye, sir!

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:35.340
Aye aye, sir!

00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:38.400
- Aye aye, sir!
- Aye aye, sir!

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:41.350
Descendants of the Goblins!

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:46.360
I know that you are hiding here!
Come out with your hands up!

00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:49.360
I will spare your lives!

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:52.800
- What do we do?
- There's a lot of them.

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:53.860
Tsubaki?

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:59.770
Fena and Yukimaru probably went
to where we were planning to go.

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:01.370
The final destination
of our voyage.

00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:07.380
Which means our role
is to act as a shield for them.

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:09.850
We might get killed.

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:11.640
If it happens, it happens.

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:27.700
No sign of them, sir.

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:31.280
Search every nook and cranny.
They're hiding somewhere, so--

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:01.220
Fire.

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:17.490
Did we get them?

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:27.920
They just keep coming!

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:31.250
Quit your whining, antling!

00:08:47.140 --> 00:08:50.810
I'll be with you soon.

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:42.030
Why? This is so familiar...

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:48.360
Fossilized wood.

00:09:54.620 --> 00:09:55.840
Fena.

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:58.040
What's that?

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:28.320
Abel...

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:36.580
What are you doing here?

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:42.090
Fena, get back!

00:10:44.980 --> 00:10:46.980
It was you who told me.

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:56.310
Those with the calling
will be guided to Eden.

00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:03.950
What are you talking about?

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:07.840
This is our promised place.

00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:13.510
You needn't worry, Helena.
Eternity is ours at last.

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:18.820
Look around you.
This flower garden is our world.

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:32.510
So...

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:35.390
It's you again.

00:12:06.460 --> 00:12:09.720
I won't let you
stand in my way again.

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:16.460
Yukimaru!

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:24.040
As long as you keep appearing before me,
I will keep killing you.

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:40.750
Damn it!

00:13:01.870 --> 00:13:06.030
I see... The boy that night,
that was you.

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:09.400
How amusing.

00:13:12.590 --> 00:13:15.040
- Fena, get back!
- I won't!

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:19.120
Stay away!

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:21.890
Helena...

00:13:34.260 --> 00:13:35.380
Fena?

00:13:35.820 --> 00:13:37.290
I won't let you

00:13:37.390 --> 00:13:39.290
hurt Yukimaru ever again!

00:13:40.930 --> 00:13:43.810
I'll keep Yukimaru safe!

00:13:48.020 --> 00:13:50.640
I see,
so that's how it is.

00:13:51.590 --> 00:13:55.280
As long as he is here,
Helena won't appear.

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:58.030
It's all clear to me now.

00:13:59.890 --> 00:14:04.540
Stand aside, Fena.
You aren't Helena.

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:09.540
You're of no further use to me.

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:13.320
Fena! Stand aside!

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:16.460
No! If you try to fight
injured like that, you're going to--

00:14:18.260 --> 00:14:19.510
What?!

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:16.690
What?

00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:22.950
It can't be...

00:15:38.340 --> 00:15:39.460
Abel.

00:15:46.350 --> 00:15:48.480
Mother?

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:04.190
At last I've found you.

00:16:07.890 --> 00:16:10.890
I came to find you, Helena.

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:13.450
Just like I promised I would.

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:16.670
I said I would come find you,
no matter what.

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:21.740
I'm sorry I took so long...

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:34.480
Helena...

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:31.330
What kept you?

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:37.330
Did you take a wrong turn again?

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:40.290
I'm sorry...

00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:45.810
It's okay. You found your way here
like you said you would.

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:50.600
Abel,

00:17:51.620 --> 00:17:54.600
It must have been difficult.

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:03.110
Crybaby.

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:23.430
Helena, my hands have become
drenched in blood.

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:26.200
I've killed so many.

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:30.460
I'm not fit to hold you anymore.

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:44.400
I wanted to be with you.
I wanted to be at your side.

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:47.990
Forever. And ever.

00:18:49.740 --> 00:18:53.610
That's... That's all I wanted...

00:18:55.870 --> 00:19:00.090
Abel, your task is complete.

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:05.510
We'll be together forever now.

00:19:07.130 --> 00:19:10.780
Let's go, Abel.
To our world.

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:41.690
Fena.

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:45.460
Mother?

00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:50.420
What comes next is up to you.

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:55.460
I'm sure you will do fine.

00:21:00.390 --> 00:21:02.650
Wait! Mother! Wait!

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:14.980
In the story that is you,
their roles ended with their deaths.

00:21:18.060 --> 00:21:20.620
How... can you be here?

00:21:20.720 --> 00:21:22.470
It's not possible!

00:21:30.820 --> 00:21:33.070
Father...?

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:37.070
I am not your father.

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:41.950
We are symbols.

00:21:46.590 --> 00:21:47.500
Cody?!

00:21:49.250 --> 00:21:51.630
I am the Observer.

00:21:52.130 --> 00:21:54.160
I am the storymaker

00:21:56.370 --> 00:21:58.280
<b>of the tale that is you.</b>
